   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "SEEDVR2 BATCH UPSCALE (one clip at a time \u2014 for the full batch of 8, run\nutilities\\batch_upscale_seedvr2.py which uses CLI directory mode).\n\n1. Set the VHS_LoadVideoPath `video` widget to the clip filename (or full path).\n2. Resolution: SeedVR2VideoUpscaler widgets \u2014 1080/1920 = HD, 1440/2560 = 2K.\n3. Queue Prompt -> output\\jaisal_cut\\upscaled\\<name>.mp4\n\nModel: seedvr2_ema_7b_sharp_fp16 (max quality). batch_size 1 (VRAM-safe).\nSource fps is preserved (24fps clips stay 24fps). NO audio in output \u2014\naudio is added in post (DaVinci) with the dub."
   ]
  }
